  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): オオアカバナ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AA%E3%82%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%82%AB%E3%83%90%E3%83%8A",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106351081,
      "text": "オオアカバナ は、アカバナ科アカバナ属の多年草。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Epilobium hirsutum",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epilobium_hirsutum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1375033254,
      "text": "Epilobium hirsutum is a flowering plant belonging to the willowherb genus Epilobium in the family Onagraceae. It is commonly known as the great willowherb, great hairy willowherb or hairy willowherb. Local dialectal names include codlins and cream, apple pie and cherry pie."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Epilobium hirsutum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epilobium_hirsutum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171671899,
      "text": "La hierba de San Antonio o epilobio velludo es una planta herbácea perenne de la familia Onagraceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Épilobe à grandes fleurs",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89pilobe_%C3%A0_grandes_fleurs",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 232606995,
      "text": "L'épilobe à grandes fleurs, encore appelée épilobe hirsute, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs du genre Epilobium et de la famille des Onagraceae. De la souche longuement stolonifère partent chaque printemps, de nouvelles tiges dressées. L'épilobe hirsute appartient souvent à une formation végétale prairiale, constituée de grandes herbes, généralement des dicotylédones à larges feuilles, appelée mégaphorbiaie."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Epilobium hirsutum",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epilobium_hirsutum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 54806704,
      "text": "Epilobium hirsutum é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Onagraceae."
    }
